ing her own life, 17-year-old 'Lisa McVey' is kidnapped and finds herself fighting to stay alive and is raped. She manages to talk her attacker into releasing her, but when she returns home, no one believes her story except for one detective, who suspects she was abducted by a serial killer. Based on horrifying true events.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":363992,\"title\":\"The Wizard of Lies\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8k4lJ4e0hvDQtKpItXmmPdw69sO.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ims0V4WEUYt6JgfvPIyH9G79q40.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A look behind the scenes at Bernie Madoff's massive Ponzi scheme, how it was perpetrated on the public and the trail of destruction it left in its wake, both for the victims and Madoff's family.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1100795,\"title\":\"Mr. Monk's Last Case: A Monk Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gj74sUGsPMg5qDQooh8GTs4MvbP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AhmzDeQR3VF0Xp2dMVFPIOxNyFg.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Monk steps out of retirement as his stepdaughter's wedding turns tragic when her fiancé dies in a bungee jumping accident.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":336845,\"title\":\"Cleveland Abduction\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j2iCc5fjyJvKRQAW7d6XWwDFzmr.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lG8T8NMJHfBgxvobVBMy0rFR2OM.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A single mother becomes Ariel Castro's first kidnapping victim, and finds herself trapped in his home with two other women for 11 years.\",\"genres\":[\"Crime\",\"TV Movie\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":457840,\"title\":\"Psych: The Movie\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/82Z6LEnkewH40